WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.400
Hello, my FlourisHealers. I want to share the behind the scenes of what it would look

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:13.960
like to go on a retreat, what all it entails, what you will get, what you'll be walking

00:00:13.960 --> 00:00:20.280
into. I know traveling overseas can feel a little scary, especially if you decide to

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:26.559
travel by yourself. And so I just wanted to share exactly what I am putting together so

00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:31.879
you don't have to think about anything. So you're getting poured into and so that you

00:00:31.879 --> 00:00:38.320
know you get a little feel of everything that you will, not everything, but a little bit

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:43.919
of what you're going to be seeing once you get to Bali. So I will go ahead and share

00:00:43.919 --> 00:00:53.080
the screen. Okay, so once you land into Bali, you will get transferred over in a luxury

00:00:53.080 --> 00:00:59.919
shuttle to get to our private villa. And this is what the private villa looks like.

00:00:59.919 --> 00:01:07.040
As you can see, the individual rooms right in front of this infinity pool, lovely pool

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:14.959
area where you can sit and relax and just unwind. We'll also be eating there where we'll

00:01:14.959 --> 00:01:21.720
have a private chef meal each night unless we go out. But overall, you'll have a private

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:27.040
chef meal where you don't have to think about cooking or who to cook for or anything like

00:01:27.040 --> 00:01:34.720
that. It will be all prepared for you. And we'll gather as a sisterhood with fellow mental

00:01:34.720 --> 00:01:42.000
health providers, wellness providers, all in one table. If you do want to get a little

00:01:42.000 --> 00:01:48.400
bit of exercise in, you have that option to do so. Of course, not mandatory, but if this

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:53.279
is something a part of your journey, I don't want to take that away. And so that is there

00:01:53.279 --> 00:02:00.879
for you. We will also have some meditation experiences as well. So all right here in

00:02:00.879 --> 00:02:08.160
the villa, you will be able to get that experience. And let me just show you again the table setting

00:02:08.160 --> 00:02:15.479
that we'll be able to sit at and gather at, talk amongst each other, all of the things.

00:02:15.479 --> 00:02:20.240
And then here's a good look at what your private room will look like once you get into

00:02:20.240 --> 00:02:26.720
your private room. Everything is there. You don't have to worry about cleaning up afterwards.

00:02:26.720 --> 00:02:31.080
Everything is pretty much taken care of. All you need to do is pack your bags, get your

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:37.320
passport if need be, or make sure your passport does not expire within the timeframe. And

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:47.759
you will be able to indulge in this beautiful private space where you have the view of greenery,

00:02:47.759 --> 00:02:57.759
scenery, all of the things. We also will do some massages on the villa. So we'll go outside

00:02:57.759 --> 00:03:03.679
the villa to have a spa day and we'll do some spa massages or have massages inside the villa

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:11.160
as well. And this is the outside bathing area. So you can take that opportunity if you like.

00:03:12.119 --> 00:03:20.279
And the living space area where we can all gather, sit and talk, just reflect on anything.

00:03:21.080 --> 00:03:28.759
Of course, you have the option to get into the pool and just relax there. Sit around the pool.

00:03:28.759 --> 00:03:35.839
We'll also be able to have breakfast, like floating breakfast going on as long as the weather permits.

00:03:35.839 --> 00:03:45.119
And so this is all of what you'll get, a piece of what you'll get once you join us in the Bali

00:03:45.119 --> 00:03:52.240
retreat experience. And so if you are interested and if you have questions, feel free to reach out

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:59.440
to me. You can book a session, a 20-minute retreat questionnaire session. I will go deeper

00:03:59.440 --> 00:04:06.479
into any questions that you may have. But I really want you to take this opportunity to

00:04:06.479 --> 00:04:13.839
invest in yourself, invest in your business if you are in business, to just reflect, get poured

00:04:13.839 --> 00:04:22.640
back into, see what it's like to be surrounded by like-minded women and leave with the experience

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:30.959
of a lifetime. The experience of being able to not have to worry about anything, not have to put

00:04:30.959 --> 00:04:37.920
things together, not having to set your own itinerary. All of that will be taken care of.

00:04:37.920 --> 00:04:43.600
So again, if you have any questions, feel free to reach out and I will be super excited to have you

00:04:44.239 --> 00:04:50.559
as one of the women right there in Bali with us. Hope to see you soon.

